{"id":"vod_sn_149409","vodId":"149409","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猫与龙","name_cn":"猫与龙","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260627-1/829f71062fbe2eeb7832a06bbba33d95.jpg"},"summary":"在深邃的森林深处，一只会喷火的龙，与一群能操纵魔法的猫咪一同生活着。这只在出生前便失去亲生父母的龙，被一只偶然相遇的母猫抚养长大。对猫咪们而言，它只是只能在天空飞翔、会吐出火焰的「有点特别的猫」，迎接进了家族之中。生活在森林中的猫咪们，各自拥有截然不同的个性与生活方式。龙仿佛是为了报答母猫的恩情，始终陪伴在森林里的猫咪们身边，并守护着它们。猫咪们亲昵地称呼它为「翅膀大叔」。而在人类眼中，这只龙则被敬畏地称为——猫龙。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-12 21:57:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202606/27/PuS2mAWxBe27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/04/CZ5buCziwZ27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/11/kjbVGMQGpZ27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/18/ghrfJaQFh927/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/25/QrNPVJ3Ksj27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/01/rFR9K0NMxr27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/08/3yrKjf3R3u27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/15/dBKvna27eK27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/22/WsQqGUsqdK27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/29/YyN6Fd07sT27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v15.rstu6.com/202609/05/BaKaN11w9L27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202609/12/6SFQ5AVm2627/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:36.346Z"}